hat make me reconsider when you  look at the night Kings clothes you can  see that they usually have a blue tint  to their color even before they use  filters and post-production here is a  picture of the night King walking around  the set and you can see the green screen  in the back still and his clothes still  have a blue tint to them  but the person who is writing the dragon  does not have that same color to their  clothes now I know there is a bright  light shining down on the Dragon which  could change the color of things but it  still looks mostly brown to me also the  night King has a very unique texture to  his clothes and boots  there is ridges on his boots in this  photo and it's kind of layered like fish  scales which does look different than  the person who is on this dragon now  when you look at the pattern on John's  clothes it looks a lot more like the one  on the dragon it has the rectangular  shapes on it and the boots don't have  those funky looking ridges on them but  the biggest similarity is what is around  the person's waist look at the mane on  the dragon it appears as if he is  wearing a sword belt which we all know  the night king does not wear but John  does wear a sword belt John also carries  long claw on his left side so you  wouldn't see it in the photo of the  person on the dragon but like I said at  the beginning of the video I want to  keep this short because I don't want to  overanalyze this photo simply because I  don't know where it came from and I  don't know how old it actually is I just  thought it was interesting because the  clothes do look more similar to John's  then the night Kings in my opinion but  then again I know nothing what I do know  is we've never seen John on a dragon he  did pet dragon and Daenerys tried to  rescue him with her dragons but John  never actually set on one yet so there  is no reason for there to be any photos  out there of John sitting on this thing  unless he is writing one in season eight  there is also a chance that HBO  purposely put this on the internet for  people to talk about it but if they  wanted to spread misinformation then why  not just take a better photo  that clearly shows it's John instead of  just some person's leather armor and leg  if HBO already knows John will never  ride a dragon then they should just  release a picture of his whole body  showing his face with him sitting on the  green-screen mechanical dragon that  would really throw people off but since  it looks like someone tried to secretly  take this photo without people seeing  them do it it does add some intrigue to  the photo at least for me at the end of  the day it probably is of the night king  but I think there is enough differences  in his clothes and this person's clothes  to add some dowel  but let me know what you think about  this one who do you believe this person  is on the dragon put all your opinions  or questions down below in the comment  section I want to thank everyone for  stopping by to watch the quick video and  I also want to thank my patreon  supporters have a great day everyone  I'll see you soon bye  [Music]  you  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]

